# Model Comparison

Each model was tested across the same prompts and topics.

## Key Differences

- GPT → Balanced system + optimization ideas  
- Gemini → More technical and detailed  
- DeepSeek → Service and infrastructure focused  
- Claude → More human-centered and social  
- Grok → More sensory and experiential ideas  

## Key Similarity

Despite differences in style:

All models produced ideas that fit into the same small set of structural patterns.

## Example

Different outputs:

- "AI learning pathways"  
- "AI learning concierge"  
- "adaptive education systems"  

All map to:

Tech + Personalization system

## Conclusion

Model variation affects expression, not underlying idea structure.
